{
  "id": "1CO.14",
  "number": "14",
  "bookId": "1CO",
  "reference": "1 Gorinto 14",
  "verseCount": 40,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'asha suuk goona Guroorooda Ghaydit",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anung' ghoah bariinyeega, gida jea agassa, nea goosinyi badiida aba haleanjeeda jea eegu bea guroorooda, raanya gideabali ghoaramwaarji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba siida baloola iit nuut meabaloola buuneeda goobalool ASEETA; aba gideaba manda siida nal ng'asheagaaschi, niny gwaruku makcheameeda funyaat aba jeeda Guroorooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba meatkweeda niirja, siida ramoorani goobalool buuneeda aba giidiing'nooda nyaawa nea goomajeek ea geandeayda salagheang'da. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida baloola iit nuut goomajeek geaw niny, nea siida ruku ramooranga goomajeek ganiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geagasayi aniini gideaba gajabaloolana iit nuut, nea ghwaraanya muuchi gideaba gajaramoarana. Aba gideaba siida ramoorani ea haweewa siida baloola iit nuut, geaghus gwaroopu siinuut, ak abeeda geemajeek ganiisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa fuga eaduupcheewi, iyaawunyi heedeang'wa ak geabalooli aba iit nuut, abeeda gaydanung' anyagaadaydaan, geaghus darukuneegwa nea ghaadahaaji ghana aba fughareeda, ghana daramooran, ghana aba giinealshooda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara haleanjeeda mandeawana gurooruunatka, uurji durumbeati, ghanea gidoondooriida gil, iimwanya nea gwaheeli nyeashta, gajeanaldaan duumda was? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba giiguuleanda iinyaa nyeashta meanala, gajea ng'eaha siida jea ea hidaat aba ng'ucheeda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwasunu eara agooga; iyoobalooli iit nuut meanala, gajea ng'eaha jea ghwanal gissirgu? Aba gideaba gajuurjeewana siida rukwiisa ng'asheega jeameeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwanda iidiga saang'a heeli aba jeeda ng'eanyiida, ak ea manda dea meanala girugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda iimwaanali ginyah iitida, gaydoaw rabascheanda aba heeda siida balool nea siida balool gayghoah rabascheanda aba heedeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasunu eara aba heedeang'wa; aba gideaba googasayi muuchi gideaba gajahuuwa fuga mideawa uurda aba Guroorooda, agassa muuchi gideaba gajandeawana ak ghoadeaschi ganiisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi, siida baloola iit nuut ea damwaasha ASEETA eataw roopiideayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba iyaamwaashchi ASEETA aba iit nuut, ghamwaash guroroodeanyu ASEETA, nea fughareedeanyu ea mandeawana haghweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gaydasin naaha? Gaydamwaash ASEETA aba guroorooda earada gaydamwaash aba fughareeda, gaydasarman aba guroorooda ak gaydasarman earada aba fughareeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara gwasa, ang'iing'i iibadiischeesi aba guroorooda, siidida uurji gilimida jaroodean gaygwayeendaan “Amina” iing'ata badiischeesiindaang'u iimwanala gidirgu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwadeepa badiischeesiina muuchi, iidu siida niirja ea maloosiina gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geabadiischeesi ASEETA aba gideaba geabalooli iit nuut ea daadarameagwa oogasean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amadu, aba jeeda ganiisa ghaabwariinyi gideaba gaydabaloola ng'asha muut aba fughareedeanyu, ak ghaanaali buuneeda suurja, ea ghwalaabwa hoowa gideaba gaydabaloola ng'asha sagalamnyooji damanamughuush aba iit nuut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga eaduupcheewi, adoahuuyi diibiga aba fughareengeagwa; ahuwa diibiga aba ng'asheega munyas, nea aba fughareengeagwa ghoahuuyi fuga hees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geang'waar aba jeeda deaweeda gideaba, “Aba ghuusiga fuga baloola iit nuut, ea biissa ghuusiga rabasta gaydeabalool fiisu, ak eara gwasa ghanyea maygooleeysean iit, gwarugu Ng'utamiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi, iit nuut gwadeagooda gil ak ea maba fuga mideawa masaweega, gaba fuga mandeawana masaweega, nea ramooranga ea maba fuga mideawa masaweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi iibwat geat ganiiseesean ak gabaloola sean iit nuut, amadu ghwahidu gah fuga jarooda, ghanea fuga mandeawana masaweega gil, heapi maygwayi goobeayi geasi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ramoaran sean, amadu ghwahidu gah siida iiyiin gaygoohiimsa munyindaanyi, nea ng'asheegiga sean iiyiin gaygoorgweaksa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makcheameeda jeadaanyi gajeanung' ghwadaajiit; ak abeeda gwatkuy, ak gayghabwat ASEETA ak gwarugu gideaba aba huumwa ASEETA gwanda jeedeang'wa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga eaduupcheewi, asi gajeeyeenaan? Iyoabwachi geat, gaba siisi mideawa duumda, ea giinealshooda, ea giidaheachta, ea iit nuut, ghana roopunooda ng'asheega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida iibaloola iit nuut, ea dabaloola fih iyeenya ghanea samwagu gil adaghwanaawa, nea dasina galanyoojiga gwayamuutooschi; ak ea daroopuuna siyagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimanda siichea gwaroopu, ea daba siisi siinda aba jeeda ganiisa, deabaloola geaw niny ea ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea sibanga ea dabaloola nea iyeenya ghanea samwagu, ak ea dasikteawana ng'asheega sirugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iisiitaheachsa ng'asheanda siinuut apteada, ea dasiinda siida ghwanyawa bea madeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ghoamuuschi oogasean gaba siisi ramoaran, ak abeeda ghwanal sean, nea geemajeek sean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea gurooruunatka sibanga iissa gwasissa gadiyeeda sibanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ASEETA mii ASEETA ang'uutooschi fih gil, niny gaba hoyyoo. Gawuurji aba jeeda ganiisajeega sean bea fuga ghaydidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gadeemga ea dasiinda aba jeesinga ganiisajeega. Aba gideaba manda gheata jea gabaloola, gagasa gweada geat ng'eanyi, gawuurji ginyaashta deaweeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama mida ng'asheanda wassean gasa ghwanal, ea daanyaasha siyeenatka nyaawa aba ghoah. Aba gideaba gaba baspaseega gideaba gaygabalool gatmooda aba jeeda ganiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 14:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heapi! Ng'asheanda ASEETA ghang'eada heedeang'wa ghana hisseegwa agooga nea goobwaageadi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.14.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.14.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
